  "deviations_from_upstream": [
    "Their vanilla arm calls openai:gpt-5.4-mini and claude_code:claude-sonnet-4-6; this offline reproduction replaces them with three deterministic baselines (naive_head = their hierarchical_summarize proxy, naive_tail = their temporal_window proxy, naive_truncate = pure character truncation). Their LLM numbers are NOT claimed as ours.",
    "Classification uses the regex baseline, not the LLM-adjudicated cascade, so the identified constraint sets differ from the paper's runs.",
    "Their experiment ran 5 rounds on 20 configs of the full-corpus E2 stratum; we run 10 rounds on the shipped 327-file sample subset (n configurable), cycles 6-10 are our extension beyond their protocol.",
    "Their loop reclassifies post-compaction text with the cached cascade each round for LLM arms; naive_head/naive_tail rebuild the KB with the regex classifier (from_lines), which is the offline equivalent."
  ],
